{"l":8160,"g":8,"b":4,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The article claims that the new phone is a revolution. In reality, it is almost identical to last year's model, apart from a slightly better camera.' Hvad mener skribenten om artiklen?","o":["Den er præcis","Den er for kort","Den overdriver","Den handler om kameraer"],"a":"Den overdriver","r":"'In reality' viser, at telefonen næsten er som sidste år. Artiklen overdriver altså."},
